# LOMBARD FLOWER BED: down the crooked block's brick lane, an ollie over the lane's curb onto the low brick
# wall round a flower bed (0.6 m above the lane) and a 50-50 round the bed until it stalls on the climb back.
# The grind taps start late: tapped at the pop, the lane's curb catches first and the wall beside it blocks it.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 teleport -247.99 698.37 20.25 34.5
cmd 3 set skater.vel.x 2.835
cmd 3 set skater.vel.y 4.119
hold ollie 30..62
tap grind 74..110 every 4
bot balance
run 900
expect event grindStart{trick=FS 50-50,line=ledge_-248_698} within 73..77
expect event grindEnd{reason=stall} within 770..774
expect event gap{id=lombard_bed,gap=LOMBARD FLOWER BED,points=300} within 770..774
expect no event bail
expect event goalComplete{id=lombardbed} within 770..774
